# Workspace output, not source: `import-catalog` writes data/puzzles.json, and
# `auto` calls it on every run. Both files used to be tracked as byte-identical
# copies of the package data under src/btc_puzzle_lab/data/, so a single `auto`
# run left the checkout dirty. The packaged copies are the source of truth;
# read_puzzles_json() and read_bundled_export_csv() fall back to them.
